{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the girl uncovers the truth of her past, she gradually overcomes her trauma. <br>Join the wounded girl on her journey to find her true self. <br>Disorder is a roguelike dungeon crawler.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1332340/extras/0b8bbde6aae5a1d4e4815730d4a8c334.poster.avif?t=1751944338\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1332340/extras/0b8bbde6aae5a1d4e4815730d4a8c334.webm?t=1751944338\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1332340/extras/0b8bbde6aae5a1d4e4815730d4a8c334.mp4?t=1751944338\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Fight to Reclaim Your Memories</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become a girl who has lost her memories and uncover the truth. The story unfolds as you grow stronger with each escape attempt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1332340/extras/497b8dfec8c49cf7e9fcd5706eb39669.poster.avif?t=1751944338\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1332340/extras/497b8dfec8c49cf7e9fcd5706eb39669.webm?t=1751944338\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1332340/extras/497b8dfec8c49cf7e9fcd5706eb39669.mp4?t=1751944338\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Designed for Replayability</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The department store is constantly changing, offering a new experience with every run. <br>Use the Gift Desk to become stronger and acquire abilities to tackle your next escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1332340/extras/ff0835e6b9ec9bc61f4581ac1a52b784.poster.avif?t=1751944338\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1332340/extras/ff0835e6b9ec9bc61f4581ac1a52b784.webm?t=1751944338\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1332340/extras/ff0835e6b9ec9bc61f4581ac1a52b784.mp4?t=1751944338\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >No Failure in Any Challenge</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even if you're not an expert player, anyone can enjoy the flashy skills and exciting story through permanent enhancements. <br>Are you a pro? It\u2019s time to put your controls to the test. Take the challenge!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"e860bcb187e1f7a6a7739a476e0f783e46732d71.jpg","localized_name":"Faust","name":"Faust","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1332340/e860bcb187e1f7a6a7739a476e0f783e46732d71.jpg"},{"icon":"2238e2f83d1b3f77586a60c82fb4684f05df6317.jpg","localized_name":"Hairdresser of desire","name":"Hairdresser of desire","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1332340/2238e2f83d1b3f77586a60c82fb4684f05df6317.jpg"},{"icon":"f28692d968ce707d7442718024771a75609eb1b3.jpg","localized_name":"Samurai","name":"Samurai","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1332340/f28692d968ce707d7442718024771a75609eb1b3.jpg"},{"icon":"c9323c557c9384b38716d373e15ee13e12245336.jpg","localized_name":